Source code
-----------

The corresponding source of a distributed build is made of this repository
(branding, build tooling, tests, desktop shell, documentation) and of the
component repositories below, all published at https://github.com/leag1234
(branch "elixiroffice"; unmodified components come from Euro-Office):

  DocumentServer, core, sdkjs, web-apps, server, dictionaries,
  document-server-integration, document-server-package, document-templates,
  core-fonts, document-formats.

